Bucketizes 'input' based on 'boundaries'.

  For example, if the inputs are
      boundaries = [0, 10, 100]
      input = [[-5, 10000]
               [150,   10]
               [5,    100]]

  then the output will be
      output = [[0, 3]
                [3, 2]
                [1, 3]]

